th) reveals a hidden grouping; street names are all distinct and the data description confirms segments share no carriageway, junction, or corridor.\",\"The workflow enforces uniqueness, raising SystemExit if any segment_id repeats, so the frozen data could not have entered the test with duplicated units.\",\"The selected report explicitly asserts one paired row per segment and that the 24 trials are 24 independent sites, and this is verifiable against the frozen data: recomputation confirms 18 quieter of 24 with no ties, median change -1.450 dB(A), and exact two-sided p = 380102/16777216 ≈ 0.022656, matching the reported figures.\",\"No authority lock was minted, so lock_follows_declaration is not-applicable-no-lock.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"absence","lock_follows_declaration":"not-applicable-no-lock","reasons":["Declared independent-unit column segment_id contains 24 unique values (S01-S24) across 24 rows, so each independent unit contributes exactly one row to the analysis.","The sign test is paired within a row: both procedure arms (pre_lnight_db and post_lnight_db) come from the same row, so no independent unit appears more than once in either arm.","No other column (street_name, lanes, length) reveals a hidden grouping; street names are all distinct and the data description confirms segments share no carriageway, junction, or corridor.","The workflow enforces uniqueness, raising SystemExit if any segment_id repeats, so the frozen data could not have entered the test with duplicated units.","The selected report explicitly asserts one paired row per segment and that the 24 trials are 24 independent sites, and this is verifiable against the frozen data: recomputation confirms 18 quieter of 24 with no ties, median change -1.450 dB(A), and exact two-sided p = 380102/16777216 ≈ 0.022656, matching the reported figures.","No authority lock was minted, so lock_follows_declaration is not-applicable-no-lock.